# KEEPERS RED ON PROGRAM ITSELF, OWED: each still runs on every gate, its words kept, and its failure is
# this line's debt rather than the gate's verdict. One a line: the keeper, its owner, why. A keeper here
# that PASSES fails the gate until its line is struck, so the list only shrinks; a line with no owner
# fails too. Measured on program 6e7371be (the static keepers by `make -k keepers-static`; the rest named
# red by the lead).
ui-browser ui-lead a cold load carries 149974 octets down, past first_paint.budget's recorded 126000 (train35)
store-held-plant lane-spec-harness the held-store case cannot be built: every walk over a read-back item stops at its `written` count, so no grown typing reaches a fresh store; packages/cli/src/commands/tests/store_held_test.av holds the trace, and the plant is owed the day a walk passes `written`
determinism lane-r2-first-paint a forked cold check keeps reads by which worker met a generator's run first: `generated` answers gain or lose a type's signature reads between two forked runs (.112.26(b))
